  "sourceTitle": "Raw Nacho Cheese",
  "sourceText": "Raw Nacho Cheese\nBy: Carrie Barr\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:17pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups Cashews (optional: soaked in water for 1-2 hours)\n1 Red Bell\n3/4 cup Nutritional Yeast\n1 clove of Garlic\nJuice of 1 Lemon\n\nSea salt to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine above ingredients in a blender. Add water as needed until the nacho cheese consistency is achieved. Salt to taste.",
